Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, gvfs, fonts-noto-core
Recommends: gvfs-backends, xdg-user-dirs, xdg-utils
Description: file manager for Patrone Linux
 Patrone File Manager is the file manager of Patrone Linux, in the image of
 Windows 11's File Explorer: tabs, the command bar, breadcrumbs, the
 navigation pane with Quick access, Home, Gallery and This PC, eight views,
 the details and preview panes, Windows-style right-click menus, Folder
 Options and Properties, and copying, moving and deleting with progress,
 conflict handling and undo. It works with the Recycle Bin (the trash),
 removable drives and network places through GIO.
